WEBVTT

01:37.120 --> 01:39.620
Mankind has written history without dragons,

01:39.620 --> 01:42.950
but in an alternative version,
dragons show up everywhere.

01:42.950 --> 01:45.250
The efforts and sacrifices of the generations

01:45.250 --> 01:49.380
have buried the revived
Dragon King to this day.

01:51.170 --> 01:55.090
For those children,
these things are still far away,

01:55.880 --> 01:58.760
so there is no need for them to grieve us.

01:58.760 --> 02:01.180
They still think that dragon-slaying

02:01.180 --> 02:03.080
is a fun and passionate endeavor,

02:04.010 --> 02:06.310
worthy of a lifetime of struggle.

02:07.210 --> 02:09.200
And that's just fine.

02:13.400 --> 02:16.150
Have you detected an unknown dragon?

02:17.410 --> 02:20.760
Where am I going to find a
dragon in broad daylight?

02:22.040 --> 02:24.150
Have you used a Yanling?

02:25.330 --> 02:26.800
I'd love to use one.

02:26.800 --> 02:28.620
Lu Mingze, that scammer!

02:28.620 --> 02:30.750
I risked a quarter of my
life to get a Yanling,

02:30.750 --> 02:32.130
but it can only be used once,

02:32.130 --> 02:34.170
and there's no after-sales service!

02:35.990 --> 02:37.500
What kind of questions are these?

02:37.500 --> 02:38.800
Mingfei!

02:38.990 --> 02:41.160
Go down and buy a bag of
sausages and some onions,

02:41.160 --> 02:43.100
and check to see if they do express delivery!

02:43.910 --> 02:45.910
I'm going! I'm going right now!

02:49.970 --> 02:53.040
Dear Ricardo, according to
the admission information,

02:53.040 --> 02:55.450
your birthday is July 17th,

02:55.450 --> 02:57.180
and you turn 19 today.

02:57.180 --> 02:58.800
On this important day,

02:58.800 --> 03:01.810
on behalf of the president and faculty in the academic affairs committee,

03:01.810 --> 03:03.090
I wish you a happy birthday.

03:03.740 --> 03:06.000
Yours sincerely, Norma.

03:07.250 --> 03:08.550
Birthday?

03:08.550 --> 03:09.550
Oh, right.

03:10.050 --> 03:11.340
Today is my birthday.

03:14.450 --> 03:15.300
Brother?

03:15.960 --> 03:17.300
Happy birthday.

03:18.450 --> 03:20.880
When did I add Brother on WeChat?

03:22.540 --> 03:23.330
Chen Wenwen.

03:28.100 --> 03:29.230
Lu Mingfei.

03:29.230 --> 03:30.400
I'm Chen Wenwen.

03:30.400 --> 03:34.410
Today at 11:30 AM, the literature club is
getting together at Sophie Ladd's Pizza House.

03:34.410 --> 03:37.010
Come along if you get this message.

03:38.610 --> 03:39.630
Fine, I'll go.

03:41.430 --> 03:43.530
Although I think it's a bit pointless,

03:46.840 --> 03:48.830
let's treat it as a goodbye to the past.

03:48.830 --> 03:50.130
Mingfei!

03:50.130 --> 03:51.870
Why haven't you left yet?

03:51.870 --> 03:53.080
I'm going right now!

03:53.080 --> 03:54.840
Your uncle broke the toilet seat.

03:54.840 --> 03:56.540
Go buy a new one at the hardware store!

03:56.540 --> 03:59.590
And cut the radish and onions and
steam some sausages when you're back!

03:59.590 --> 04:01.300
We'll be back at 4:30 PM.

04:01.300 --> 04:03.550
Tonight's dinner is to celebrate
Lu Mingze studying abroad.

04:03.550 --> 04:04.530
Hurry up!

04:04.530 --> 04:05.470
I'm going!

04:08.430 --> 04:09.550
All right...

04:09.550 --> 04:10.680
Almost there...

04:10.680 --> 04:11.740
Right away...

04:11.740 --> 04:13.010
Five minutes...

04:13.010 --> 04:14.830
What's going on?

04:14.830 --> 04:15.620
It's an earthquake!

04:15.620 --> 04:16.920
Don't scare me!

04:18.230 --> 04:19.400
It's really an earthquake!

04:19.850 --> 04:21.310
Look, the station...

04:22.150 --> 04:24.000
No way... This wasn't in the forecast.

04:24.750 --> 04:25.530
The train...

04:25.530 --> 04:26.590
The train station...

04:27.040 --> 04:27.950
Run!

04:28.620 --> 04:29.370
Help!

04:30.750 --> 04:31.620
Run!

04:34.790 --> 04:35.450
Run!

04:36.500 --> 04:37.750
Run!

04:43.290 --> 04:44.870
Help!

04:45.580 --> 04:46.660
Help!

05:00.210 --> 05:01.230
What's going on?

05:01.520 --> 05:03.650
Urgent instructions from the school board.

05:04.870 --> 05:07.610
SS, the highest rank...

05:07.610 --> 05:09.230
What on earth happened?

05:09.230 --> 05:13.230
We lost some information in Xinguo
that the school board urgently needs.

05:13.230 --> 05:15.790
For this information, we went all out,

05:15.790 --> 05:17.580
came up with a detailed plan,

05:17.580 --> 05:19.510
and successfully retrieved it.

05:19.510 --> 05:23.460
Then we sent our most capable people
to bring it back to headquarters.

05:23.460 --> 05:26.780
But it was lost on the way.

05:26.780 --> 05:27.680
Norma.

05:29.550 --> 05:32.620
I've seen this hall before.
It's the south train station!

05:32.620 --> 05:34.520
It's Lu Mingfei's hometown.

05:34.520 --> 05:36.040
This morning,

05:36.040 --> 05:38.700
it was destroyed by a magnitude 3 earthquake.

05:38.700 --> 05:39.750
At that time,

05:39.750 --> 05:44.040
our specialist Raymond was waiting
for the train with that information.

05:44.040 --> 05:46.080
He was cut to pieces.

05:46.080 --> 05:47.570
The information was lost.

05:48.500 --> 05:50.040
Raymond...

05:53.910 --> 05:58.870
The school board has given us a deadline of
19:00 local time to retrieve it.

05:58.870 --> 06:01.450
There isn't enough time to
send an investigation team.

06:01.450 --> 06:03.050
We'll have to send people nearby.

06:03.450 --> 06:04.340
Who have you picked?

06:04.340 --> 06:07.510
A-ranked Chu Zihang, and S-ranked Lu Mingfei.

06:07.510 --> 06:11.190
Both of them have absolute
bloodline advantages.

06:11.190 --> 06:12.460
And both of them

06:12.460 --> 06:15.890
are there in Xinguo right now,
on summer vacation.

06:22.810 --> 06:23.840
Hello, Professor?

06:23.840 --> 06:26.660
Urgent mission, ranked SS.

06:26.660 --> 06:27.570
SS?

06:27.570 --> 06:31.830
You have to retrieve an important
piece of information by 19:00 today.

06:31.830 --> 06:34.950
Norma has already sent you the
detailed mission instructions.

06:35.320 --> 06:39.300
She has booked a direct flight to
Anguo tonight for you and Lu Mingfei.

06:39.300 --> 06:41.750
Come back immediately after
retrieving the information.

06:41.750 --> 06:42.580
Lu Mingfei?

06:42.870 --> 06:46.400
The specialist for this mission
is the S-ranked Lu Mingfei.

06:46.400 --> 06:49.760
Your job is to support him
and follow his instructions.

06:50.080 --> 06:51.010
Understood.

07:13.780 --> 07:16.160
Lu Mingfei, are you okay?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.160
I'm fine.

07:17.160 --> 07:18.800
Then why do you have a toilet seat?

07:18.800 --> 07:20.660
It's comfortable to sit on.

07:21.620 --> 07:24.250
So this is what they teach
in foreign elite universities.

07:26.750 --> 07:29.620
It must be his major.

07:29.620 --> 07:31.220
I'm going to the bathroom.

07:31.220 --> 07:33.780
It really suits you!

07:36.710 --> 07:38.220
Zhao Mengfa.

07:38.220 --> 07:39.410
Why did you suddenly open the door?

07:39.410 --> 07:40.120
I'm fine.

07:40.120 --> 07:41.480
I'm not!

07:41.480 --> 07:42.790
You did that on purpose!

07:42.790 --> 07:43.330
Did I?

07:43.330 --> 07:44.160
Lu Mingfei.

07:46.290 --> 07:47.590
Long time no see.

07:49.530 --> 07:50.290
Hi!

07:50.290 --> 07:52.310
I... I'm going to the bathroom.

07:53.360 --> 07:55.320
Boss, you're here!

07:56.400 --> 07:58.270
Let's order! I'm hungry!

07:58.270 --> 08:00.330
I'm going to eat a lot!

08:03.500 --> 08:05.080
It's only been one semester,

08:05.550 --> 08:08.090
but I can't seem to communicate
with these old classmates.

08:10.490 --> 08:11.480
Finger?

08:12.250 --> 08:13.700
Happy birthday!

08:13.700 --> 08:15.290
Happy birthday to you!

08:15.290 --> 08:17.320
Be happy every day of your life!

08:17.320 --> 08:19.200
Don't worry about how your birthday goes!

08:19.200 --> 08:20.090
Hey, hey!

08:21.190 --> 08:23.270
This is the first Chinese song
I learned to sing.

08:23.270 --> 08:25.450
You know that I'm as poor as a dog,

08:25.450 --> 08:27.710
so forget any gifts that cost money.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.450
At least you still remember me.

08:30.450 --> 08:31.570
Don't follow me.

08:31.570 --> 08:33.620
Listen to me. It's not what it looks like.

08:33.620 --> 08:34.680
What's it look like?

08:34.680 --> 08:36.580
I see her pestering you all the time.

08:36.580 --> 08:37.950
Have you told her?

08:37.950 --> 08:40.990
Why are... these two in the men's bathroom?

08:40.990 --> 08:43.660
We broke up already.
What's there to say?

08:43.660 --> 08:44.870
So you haven't told her?

08:44.870 --> 08:46.410
There's really no need.

08:46.410 --> 08:47.290
Do you know

08:47.290 --> 08:48.580
how annoying she can be?

08:48.580 --> 08:50.480
If I tell her, she'll definitely berate me,

08:50.480 --> 08:52.210
like I owe her something.

08:54.470 --> 08:56.700
If we break up in the future,

08:56.700 --> 08:58.370
will you say the same thing about me?

08:59.830 --> 09:01.550
How could I?

09:02.070 --> 09:04.850
I'd be crazy or stupid to break up with you.

09:05.250 --> 09:07.310
Hey, there are people here.

09:07.610 --> 09:08.830
Let go.

09:08.830 --> 09:10.270
What if someone sees us?

09:11.110 --> 09:12.290
Let's go back.

09:12.290 --> 09:14.900
All right. Let's go and
have a good meal first.

09:20.510 --> 09:22.280
Making out in public...

09:22.280 --> 09:23.380
Do I look dead?

09:24.190 --> 09:26.080
Is he talking about Chen Wenwen?

09:26.910 --> 09:28.560
So they've already broken up.

09:29.620 --> 09:31.330
They are already more men than women,

09:31.330 --> 09:33.380
yet you're having your cake and
eating it too, Zhao Mengfa.

09:33.640 --> 09:36.840
Oh, well. It's actually none of my business.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.950
This pizza is delicious. Have more.

09:38.950 --> 09:39.900
I've had enough.

09:39.900 --> 09:42.000
I've put on some weight recently,
so I need to eat less.

09:42.000 --> 09:43.320
Then drink some more.

09:44.680 --> 09:46.120
It's fine. I'll do it myself.

09:49.870 --> 09:51.400
Everyone's here.

09:51.700 --> 09:53.250
As everyone is here today,

09:53.250 --> 09:54.750
I have something to announce.

09:54.750 --> 09:56.080
What is it, boss?

10:01.250 --> 10:02.780
Wh-What is that?

10:11.500 --> 10:14.120
You guys can't go after
Liu Miaomiao anymore.

10:16.340 --> 10:17.550
We're...

10:18.290 --> 10:19.840
getting engaged.

10:21.130 --> 10:23.120
No wonder we're having a gathering today.

10:23.120 --> 10:25.180
You're awesome, boss!

10:25.180 --> 10:26.500
Not even leaving a shred of hope for us.

10:26.500 --> 10:27.750
Come on, put on the ring.

10:27.750 --> 10:28.910
Yeah, let's take a picture.

10:28.910 --> 10:30.400
Picture, picture!

10:30.400 --> 10:33.520
After hearing all this,
she must be the most upset.

10:33.520 --> 10:34.630
Congrats, boss!

10:34.630 --> 10:35.420
May you have a happy marriage!

10:35.420 --> 10:37.280
Congratulations!

10:38.690 --> 10:40.820
May you have a happy marriage!

10:41.570 --> 10:42.620
May you have a happy marriage!

10:42.620 --> 10:44.320
Don't you have a shred of decency?

10:51.360 --> 10:52.700
Lu Mingfei...

10:54.360 --> 10:56.880
Lu Mingfei, it's none of your business!

10:56.880 --> 10:57.840
You're right!

10:57.840 --> 10:59.410
It's none of my business!

10:59.410 --> 11:02.040
Even though you're happy,
you should give her a way out.

11:02.040 --> 11:04.910
Announcing your engagement to your
current girlfriend in front of your ex...

11:04.910 --> 11:06.260
You're doing this on purpose.

11:06.260 --> 11:07.540
Say that again!

11:07.540 --> 11:08.790
We're all classmates. Let it go.

11:08.790 --> 11:09.950
Come on!

11:09.950 --> 11:10.730
Calm down.

11:10.730 --> 11:13.040
That's enough! What day is it today?

11:13.040 --> 11:14.230
Why are you bothering with him?

11:16.060 --> 11:18.500
Fine, I won't bother with you.

11:18.500 --> 11:20.470
Waiter! The bill!

11:20.470 --> 11:23.030
I'll treat everyone to Yiguo cuisine tonight.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.760
Hello, here's your bill.

11:25.760 --> 11:27.500
Let this guy pay his own bill!

11:28.950 --> 11:30.760
D-Do you have money?

11:31.730 --> 11:34.000
I'll pay for the entire bill.

11:34.360 --> 11:35.250
Swipe the card.

11:35.250 --> 11:38.040
My S-rank Cassel College student ID card

11:38.040 --> 11:40.760
has a credit limit of
over 100,000 An dollars!

11:42.450 --> 11:43.640
Card swipe failed.

11:44.410 --> 11:45.560
It's been declined.

11:45.560 --> 11:46.830
Maybe the signal is bad!

11:46.830 --> 11:48.390
Please try again! Try again!

11:49.120 --> 11:50.510
Card swipe failed.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.980
It can't have a problem!

11:51.980 --> 11:53.360
Lu Mingfei,

11:51.980 --> 11:53.360
Please try again!

11:53.360 --> 11:54.870
will you stay and do the dishes,

11:54.870 --> 11:56.570
or perhaps fix the toilet seat?

11:56.570 --> 11:58.940
Sir, do you have other methods of payment?

11:58.940 --> 12:01.780
I-I don't have any money in my WeChat.

12:01.780 --> 12:02.290
I, I, I...

12:02.290 --> 12:03.450
I'll pay in cash.

12:07.200 --> 12:08.540
Brother?

12:17.270 --> 12:18.270
Foreign currency?

12:18.270 --> 12:18.960
Yes, we accept that.

12:18.960 --> 12:20.760
Keep the change.

12:22.120 --> 12:23.130
So much?

12:24.220 --> 12:25.180
Thank you.

12:25.680 --> 12:27.940
Brother, why are you here?

12:27.940 --> 12:29.390
The college has an urgent mission,

12:29.390 --> 12:30.810
and they're waiting for you to lead it.

12:30.810 --> 12:31.740
Boss.

12:34.120 --> 12:35.280
Boss?

12:35.280 --> 12:36.350
Who the hell are you?

12:38.540 --> 12:39.830
Chu Zihang.

12:39.830 --> 12:40.980
We're all alumni.

12:42.480 --> 12:43.880
Chu Zihang?

12:44.000 --> 12:45.000
Chu Zihang?

12:45.000 --> 12:47.700
Chu Zihang is Lu Mingfei's younger brother?

12:47.700 --> 12:50.490
Boss, the car's waiting outside.

12:54.000 --> 12:55.870
Then... let's go!

13:06.160 --> 13:06.890
The toilet seat...

13:06.890 --> 13:07.710
Allow me.

13:09.350 --> 13:13.740
Lu Mingfei... actually asked
Chu Zihang to get the toilet seat.

13:21.350 --> 13:25.490
My whole reputation is always supported
by my brothers and sisters.

13:25.790 --> 13:28.860
I really want to have a moment
to stand up for myself.

14:00.000 --> 14:03.030
Thanks... for backing me up today.

14:03.030 --> 14:04.740
I'll pay you back.

14:04.740 --> 14:06.370
The college has arranged a mission.

14:06.370 --> 14:08.070
You're in charge. I'm supporting you.

14:08.070 --> 14:10.570
So you're the boss today, no joke.

14:10.570 --> 14:11.950
Mission?

14:11.950 --> 14:13.390
I'm the boss?

14:13.390 --> 14:15.470
Are they making fun of me?

14:16.760 --> 14:18.800
A mission tonight...

14:18.800 --> 14:20.580
Such a difficult mission!

14:20.580 --> 14:23.340
The college thinks too highly of me.

14:25.760 --> 14:28.730
I... listened outside the
room for two minutes.

14:28.730 --> 14:32.210
Brother is so nosy,
and listened for two minutes!

14:32.210 --> 14:34.600
I know you liked Chen Wenwen
when you were at school.

14:35.850 --> 14:37.140
The whole school knew.

14:37.140 --> 14:39.730
For real? I thought I hid it pretty well.

14:39.730 --> 14:41.540
I don't mind you putting your foot on the seat,

14:41.540 --> 14:42.750
but it's not safe at this speed.

14:44.370 --> 14:45.000
Sorry.

14:45.000 --> 14:45.770
It's okay.

14:45.770 --> 14:47.500
As you haven't said anything,

14:47.500 --> 14:49.000
I found a topic to talk to you about.

14:50.370 --> 14:51.510
Well...

14:51.510 --> 14:52.740
Actually...

14:53.290 --> 14:55.300
We can talk about business.

14:55.870 --> 14:58.540
Chen Wenwen knew that you liked her,
but pretended not to notice,

14:58.540 --> 15:01.290
treated you badly, and used you as a lackey.

15:01.290 --> 15:03.250
Why are you still standing up for her now?

15:05.290 --> 15:07.380
She didn't treat me badly.

15:08.120 --> 15:10.720
Me liking her has nothing to do with it.

15:11.090 --> 15:12.800
Zhao Mengfa is unhappy

15:12.800 --> 15:15.000
because Chen Wenwen used
to be his girlfriend.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.540
And she still likes him.

15:16.540 --> 15:19.160
Psychologically, he is
still possessive of her.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.730
He can throw her away,

15:21.040 --> 15:23.100
but he doesn't want others
to stand up for her.

15:23.100 --> 15:24.440
Why did you do that?

15:24.970 --> 15:28.070
I'm just stupid, and can't stand
seeing people being bullied.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.790
Anyway, you won't be bullied, Brother.

15:30.790 --> 15:31.780
You don't get it!

15:35.710 --> 15:36.320
Get out.

15:36.320 --> 15:36.870
What?

15:36.870 --> 15:37.630
Quick.

15:39.440 --> 15:41.440
Wait for me here. I'll be back soon.

15:44.970 --> 15:46.950
Boss, it's too hot.

15:46.950 --> 15:49.280
Let's have some ice cream.

15:49.280 --> 15:50.450
Who told you to wear so much?

15:50.450 --> 15:52.050
It looked cool outside.

15:52.450 --> 15:55.660
Did you used to have a crush on Chu Zihang?

15:55.660 --> 15:56.250
Yeah.

15:56.730 --> 15:59.640
But he never even looked at me.

16:00.130 --> 16:00.770
Boss...

16:00.770 --> 16:04.190
How did such a handsome guy become
Lu Mingfei's younger brother?

16:04.870 --> 16:07.490
Soon, I'll let you guys eat a lot!

16:08.960 --> 16:09.570
Why...

16:09.920 --> 16:10.900
Chu Zihang...

16:10.900 --> 16:12.490
Did he come back?

16:12.490 --> 16:13.540
Chen Wenwen,

16:14.250 --> 16:16.230
Lu Mingfei said he wants to
take you out to dinner tonight.

16:16.230 --> 16:18.160
He's made a reservation at the
Aspasia restaurant tonight,

16:18.480 --> 16:19.660
for 6:30 PM.

16:20.000 --> 16:21.900
I've already passed on the
message from the boss.

16:21.900 --> 16:22.580
Do you accept?

16:23.510 --> 16:24.420
Tsk.

16:25.690 --> 16:26.790
Yes.

16:26.790 --> 16:27.960
Here is the address.

16:29.380 --> 16:30.170
Bye.

16:48.300 --> 16:51.040
Fortunately, he didn't leave
me behind in a fit of rage.

16:51.040 --> 16:53.210
Maybe I misunderstood him just now.

16:53.210 --> 16:55.620
Brother, you're a really good driver.

16:55.620 --> 16:56.360
My dad taught me.

16:57.830 --> 16:58.720
Happy birthday.

16:59.950 --> 17:01.650
Thanks, Brother.

17:01.650 --> 17:04.790
I was so touched when I got your message.

17:04.790 --> 17:06.470
Not going out to eat on your birthday?

17:06.470 --> 17:07.420
Changing the toilet seat?

17:09.750 --> 17:12.000
My aunt didn't give birth to me,

17:12.000 --> 17:14.160
so it's natural that she doesn't remember.

17:14.160 --> 17:16.090
Brother, how do you usually
spend your birthday?

17:16.090 --> 17:18.750
Cake, presents, party...

17:18.750 --> 17:19.970
It's about the same every year.

17:20.830 --> 17:22.060
Do you like Italian food?

17:22.060 --> 17:23.580
Never had it before.

17:23.580 --> 17:24.660
I like to eat meat.

17:24.660 --> 17:25.250
Good.

17:26.410 --> 17:28.370
Hello, Aspasia Restaurant?

17:28.370 --> 17:29.860
I'd like to make a reservation
for two tonight.

17:29.860 --> 17:33.030
I'm sorry, sir, the entire restaurant
has been booked tonight.

17:33.030 --> 17:34.180
Can you add another table?

17:34.180 --> 17:36.040
I'm very sorry. Please try somewhere else.

17:36.040 --> 17:36.710
Thanks.

17:37.240 --> 17:39.830
Uh... Let's go to another restaurant.

17:39.830 --> 17:41.570
It's already been scheduled,
so let's not change it.

17:42.660 --> 17:44.200
Connect me to Finger.

17:44.200 --> 17:45.080
Hello!

17:45.080 --> 17:47.170
What can I do for you, Brother Chu?

17:47.580 --> 17:51.020
Finger, I will post a reward
later with the user ID of Murasame,

17:51.020 --> 17:52.520
Can you help me get it pinned to the top?

17:55.650 --> 17:57.500
Chu Zihang has posted a reward!

17:58.340 --> 18:03.100
I want a reservation for 18:30 tonight.

18:03.100 --> 18:12.070
Coordinates: 26.08774 N, 119.28439 E.

18:04.790 --> 18:07.190
The poster is willing to
exchange it for a "favor."

18:07.190 --> 18:08.730
Wow, that's amazing!

18:08.730 --> 18:10.290
A favor from Chu Zihang.

18:10.290 --> 18:11.250
Oh, my god!

18:11.250 --> 18:13.080
...for two at Aspasia Restaurant.

18:13.080 --> 18:15.180
The name on the reservation is...

18:15.180 --> 18:16.660
...Lu Mingfei!

18:17.570 --> 18:19.130
This is very difficult...

18:22.000 --> 18:24.080
Master, your classmate called.

18:24.080 --> 18:26.080
Seems to be an member of the Student Union.

18:26.350 --> 18:27.200
Who is it?

18:27.200 --> 18:29.770
Your loyal henchman, Finger!

18:29.770 --> 18:30.480
What's up?

18:30.480 --> 18:33.290
Boss, Chu Zihang has offered a reward!

18:33.290 --> 18:34.550
Chu Zihang?

18:34.550 --> 18:36.870
Chu Zihang said the he promises
to do one thing for

18:36.870 --> 18:40.500
whoever can help Lu Mingfei sort out a
reservation at the Aspasia Restaurant tonight,

18:40.500 --> 18:43.430
so long as it's within his ability
and doesn't violate ethics.

18:43.430 --> 18:45.430
Basically, he just offered a favor:

18:45.430 --> 18:47.220
find him if you have a problem.

18:47.220 --> 18:48.670
What a joke!

18:48.670 --> 18:51.600
Lu Mingfei is a member of the
Student Union and belongs to me.

18:51.600 --> 18:54.750
If he needs help, he should
come to me and I'll help him!

18:55.960 --> 18:59.540
Call the mint club for me and
specify the Aspasia Restaurant.

18:59.540 --> 19:02.660
I want the best table,
the best chefs and the best waiters.

19:02.660 --> 19:05.120
Everything must be perfect!

19:05.410 --> 19:06.290
Yes, sir.

19:06.290 --> 19:07.670
After you've sorted it out,

19:07.670 --> 19:09.210
send a message to my classmate.

19:09.760 --> 19:11.040
His name is Lu Mingfei.

19:16.970 --> 19:18.130
It's Boss Caesar.

19:18.540 --> 19:19.800
Happy birthday.

19:20.250 --> 19:21.910
I'm so lucky to receive the blessings

19:21.910 --> 19:25.380
from the presidents of the
Lionheart Society and the Student Union.

19:28.400 --> 19:29.810
This world is so strange.

19:30.370 --> 19:32.100
Some people think I'm a pile of shit,

19:32.440 --> 19:33.770
and other people think I'm treasure.

19:36.770 --> 19:39.240
Brother, where are we going now?

19:39.530 --> 19:41.090
The ruins of the south train station.

19:41.090 --> 19:42.920
We don't have a lead on
who took the information,

19:42.920 --> 19:44.240
so we need to investigate the scene.

19:45.260 --> 19:46.790
How long will it take?

19:46.790 --> 19:48.950
Can we hurry? I'm worried about getting home late.

19:48.950 --> 19:50.350
The toilet seat won't be changed.

19:50.350 --> 19:52.040
And the onions and sausages...

19:52.040 --> 19:53.520
Tell me what you need.

19:53.520 --> 19:54.960
I'll get professionals to do it.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.910
O-Okay.

19:56.910 --> 19:58.530
Thanks, Brother.

20:00.670 --> 20:03.150
Now is when the patrol changes shifts.

20:03.150 --> 20:06.180
This is the only time to avoid the
security and enter the south station.

20:07.450 --> 20:09.020
Wow...

20:09.660 --> 20:11.600
Was the earthquake that strong?

20:11.600 --> 20:13.420
I didn't feel it at all!

20:13.420 --> 20:15.150
Yes, it's hard to imagine.

20:15.470 --> 20:17.440
The structure of the station is very stable,

20:17.440 --> 20:18.780
and should withstand
a magnitude 8 earthquake.

20:18.780 --> 20:20.950
This morning's small
earthquake was magnitude 3,

20:20.950 --> 20:23.200
so it shouldn't even be damaged.

20:24.250 --> 20:25.570
That's very strange.

20:25.840 --> 20:26.740
Let's go in.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.620
Whiskey on the rocks?

20:39.620 --> 20:41.760
XO? Or...

20:41.760 --> 20:44.300
Do you want a chicken nugget meal?

20:49.520 --> 20:50.010
Where is it?

20:58.560 --> 20:58.940
Nibelungen Program

20:58.580 --> 21:01.440
I didn't expect there to
be a Nibelungen Program.

21:01.790 --> 21:04.390
Now my key can finally be useful.

21:06.020 --> 21:08.750
The dragon bones are hidden
in the cellar of the college.

21:08.750 --> 21:11.000
What an unexpected reward.

21:11.000 --> 21:13.920
We finally meet, old friend.

21:14.330 --> 21:17.870
I risked my life to grab this
document at the south train station.

21:17.870 --> 21:18.960
Shut up.

21:26.040 --> 21:27.340
You're very efficient.

21:27.760 --> 21:28.910
I'm very satisfied.

21:28.910 --> 21:30.260
Yes...

21:33.990 --> 21:36.770
Hey, you forgot something!

21:36.770 --> 21:38.660
A courier will pick it up at 7:00 PM.

21:38.660 --> 21:39.910
Just give it to him.

21:39.910 --> 21:41.450
If he doesn't pick it up,

21:41.450 --> 21:42.880
you know the consequences.

21:53.270 --> 21:55.960
There are still three hours until 7:00 PM.

21:56.310 --> 21:58.050
In three hours,

21:58.590 --> 22:01.290
I can wash my hands of this.
